  x unknown node `source` in `modules`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-pin/image.kdl:18:9]
 17 |         }
 18 |         source "one" {
    :         ^^^|^^
    :            `-- not part of the schema
 19 |             module "remote"
    `----
  help: `modules` holds `module` entries and `flavour` blocks; `tect import
        module` copies a library module into `modules/`

  x `loose` carries a `pin`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-pin/image.kdl:13:13]
 12 |         module "loose" {
 13 |             pin {
    :             ^|^
    :              `-- an entry names a module under modules/
 14 |                 url "http://example.com/modules.zip"
    `----
  help: `tect import module <name>` copies a library module into `modules/`
        and records where it came from in `modules/modules.lock.kdl`; the
        image then lists it by its path

  x `loose` is not a module
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-pin/image.kdl:12:9]
 11 |     modules {
 12 |         module "loose" {
    :         ^^^|^^
    :            `-- nothing to build
 13 |             pin {
    `----
  help: give modules/loose a module.kdl, a module.sh, a files/ directory, a
        Containerfile.inc or a file that another module collects
